WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.550
What Learn says about the engine is
what makes this worth the trouble.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:08.225
The rule language is small and precise,
so a parser can follow it exactly.

3
00:00:08.225 --> 00:00:12.195
Comparisons ignore case, so a
lower-case code still matches,

4
00:00:12.195 --> 00:00:14.950
and the HR side has to
keep its codes clean.

5
00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.041
Processing runs one tenant at a
time and can take more than a day,

6
00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:21.638
so a mistake doesn't undo itself quickly.

7
00:00:21.638 --> 00:00:25.027
The memberOf operator is a
preview that ends in November,

8
00:00:25.027 --> 00:00:26.975
after which those groups freeze.

9
00:00:26.975 --> 00:00:30.666
And agents' user accounts
are included unless excluded,

10
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:33.940
with no documented property
to exclude them yet.
